# Build context is the repo root for both be/Dockerfile and fe/Dockerfile.
# node_modules, build output and .mastra are all regenerated inside the image;
# .env holds secrets and is supplied at runtime, never baked in.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.mastra
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.gitignore
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/README.md
**/AGENTS.md
Dockerfile*
**/Dockerfile*
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
